{"id":"665653","name":"金针菇炖热腾鱼","author":"polaris滴食记","authorId":"10301589","desc":"","cover":"images/665653/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"热腾鱼","amount":"2条"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"150克"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"1根"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"2片"}],"sub":[{"name":"菜籽油","amount":"15毫升"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"水","amount":"300毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"炒锅内倒入15毫升菜籽油，先放入2片生姜爆香。","img":"images/665653/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入处理好的热腾鱼。","img":"images/665653/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入1勺料酒去腥增香。","img":"images/665653/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入1勺生抽。","img":"images/665653/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入1勺老抽。","img":"images/665653/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入300毫升清水。","img":"images/665653/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将金针菇铺在周围。","img":"images/665653/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上锅盖大火煮开后转中火炖煮8分钟。","img":"images/665653/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"打开锅盖略微翻动一下，让其上色更均匀，撒上葱花即可关火出锅装盘。","img":"images/665653/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665653/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665653/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}